      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KRAMER (1) was in the minors when resuming at Murray Bridge where he finished third (23.02) in a Grade 6. Will strip fitter for the run. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Top prospect. SLICK SILAS (2) steps out for the first time at this course. Scored in one of the quickest times on the card (19.61) latest, winning by one length at Angle Park in a Grade 6. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. MICKEY HALLER (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 19.68 beating Let's Enjoy This. Should be in this for a long way. BUBBLE COASTER (7) hit the frame here last time and looks a chance again.",
